# SP-008: Both sugar and salt pass a filter, but only one is a strong electrolyte
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 glucose 0.001mol
new
filter v1 v2
measure v2 conductivity
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 NaCl 0.001mol
new
filter v3 v4
measure v4 conductivity
inspect
